    "title": "Former US Green Beret and Law Enforcement Expert Michael Letts on Charlie Kirk Shooting",
    "text": "In the wake of the tragic fatal shooting of conservative activist Charlie Kirk, former U.S. Green Beret and law enforcement expert Michael Letts analyzes the possible weapon used in the attack and the challenges that come with providing security for events in open spaces on college campuses. He says while conservative voices won’t be silenced, until law enforcement and the intelligence community pinpoints the source of the violence and bring it to justice, \"it's going to get worse, not better.\"\nFormer US Green Beret and Law Enforcement Expert Michael Letts on Charlie Kirk Shooting\nJoining us now is Michael Letts. He's a former green beret and law enforcement expert. He's also the CEO of In-Vest USA.\nBy\n|\nPublished: 9/10/2025, 11:55:32 PM EDT",
